# Zhou6: Sabidussi coset graph

The **Zhou-6 graph** (91 vertices, 6-regular) is Sab(PSL(2,13), D₁₂).
|PSL(2,13)| = 1092, |D₁₂| = 12, 1092/12 = 91 vertices.
-/

